   "date": "2013-10-11T12:33:12Z",
   "subject": "ggplot2 : to change the title of legend",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello\r\n<br>I don&#39;t arrive to change the title of the legend\r\n<br>My code is :\r\n<br>library(ggplot2)\r\n<br>ma &lt;- max(General$AgeChangCat) ; mi &lt;- min(General$AgeChangCat)\r\n<br>Test$Recrutement &lt;- factor(Test$CadNonCadRecrut)\r\n<br>p &lt;-\r\n<br>ggplot(Test, aes(x=factor(Cat1), y=AgeChangCat )) +\r\n<br>ylim(mi,ma) +\r\n<br>geom_point() +\r\n<br>geom_boxplot(aes(fill = Recrutement)) +\r\n<br>labs(title = &quot;Age&quot;, x=&quot;catégorie&quot;, y=&quot;Age&quot;) +\r\n<br>theme(legend.position = c(0.1,0.9), legend.background = \r\nelement_rect(colour = &quot;black&quot;))\r\n<br>p <br><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "UXXf4I7YkhQJ",
   "from": "David Guy",
   "author": "c5246646595bff41",
   "date": "2013-10-11T13:38:11Z",
   "subject": "Re: ggplot2 : to change the title of legend",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Michel,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">\r\nIn order to change the legend title use:</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">p&lt;- p + scale_fill_discrete(name=&quot;legendName&quot;)</div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\">In order to change the appearance of the title use:</span></font></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\">p + theme(legend.title = element_text(colour=&quot;red&quot;, size=8, face=&quot;bold&quot;))</span></font></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\">I hope this helps.</span></font></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap\">David</span></font></div>\r\n</d